<meta name="description" content="the signature restaurant of chablé yucatán Nestled within the old engine room of a 19th-century henequen hacienda, you’ll find Ixi’im — a space rich in character and history that welcomes visitors from all over the globe.Here, Chef Luis Ronzón turns Yucatán’s traditional ingredients into culinary masterpieces that honor their heritage&hellip;">
