				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1aac8511 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1aac8511" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">the signature restaurant of chablé yucatán</h1>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4b059439 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4b059439" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Nestled within the old engine room of a 19th-century henequen hacienda, you’ll find Ixi’im — a space rich in character and history that welcomes visitors from all over the globe.</p><p>Here, Chef Luis Ronzón turns Yucatán’s traditional ingredients into culinary masterpieces that honor their heritage while elevating their flavors.</p><p><span style="font-weight: 500;">Ixi’im is open fromTuesday through Sunday, starting at 1 p.m.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-4464a105 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4464a105" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4e423f7f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="4e423f7f" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img decoding="async" width="661" height="540" src="https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/ixiim-restaurant.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-23775" alt="ixiim-restaurant" srcset="https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/ixiim-restaurant.webp 661w, https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/ixiim-restaurant-300x245.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 661px) 100vw, 661px" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-6ba1745e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="6ba1745e" data-element_type="container">
