		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-2bf99647 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2bf99647" data-element_type="container">
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-4c8792ec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4c8792ec" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2ea4f98d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="2ea4f98d" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="661" height="539" src="https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/tequila-colection.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-23777" alt="tequila-colection" srcset="https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/tequila-colection.webp 661w, https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/tequila-colection-300x245.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 661px) 100vw, 661px" />															</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-1f3bd79b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1f3bd79b" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2273c465 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2273c465" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">the largest tequila collection in the world</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-66273fe0 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="66273fe0" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>With 3,435 bottles, Ixi’im at Chablé Yucatán boasts one of the most extensive tequila collections in the world. Its oldest label — Brindis por México by José Cuervo — dates back to 1845, and among its most prized treasures are bottles featuring artwork by the renowned Mexican muralist Rufino Tamayo.</p><p>Tequila tastings are available for guests and visitors with prior reservation.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3bb53957 elementor-tablet-align-center elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="3bb53957" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
										<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://www.opentable.com.mx/r/ixiim-chochola?lang=en-us">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">book now</span>
					</span>
					</a>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-7fb4698 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="7fb4698" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-24dda557 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="24dda557" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5937d30 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider" data-id="5937d30" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="divider.default">
							<div class="elementor-divider">
			<span class="elementor-divider-separator">
						</span>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-56796082 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="56796082" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-68c5b6d4 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="68c5b6d4" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-121d68f4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="121d68f4" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">THE CHABLÉ <span style="font-weight:600">CHEFS</span></h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2fddb42d elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2fddb42d" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Vallejo and Ronzón designed Ixi&#8217;im under the premise of embracing local traditions with a focus on sustainability.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-1656f8f4 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="1656f8f4" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-7abb0cff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7abb0cff" data-element_type="container">
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-7ce9f1fb e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7ce9f1fb" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-126cd16e elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="126cd16e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="654" height="541" src="https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/luis-rozon.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-23778" alt="luis-rozon" srcset="https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/luis-rozon.webp 654w, https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/luis-rozon-300x248.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 654px) 100vw, 654px" />															</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5029bcf8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5029bcf8" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Luis Ronzón,</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-60280d93 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="60280d93" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">EXECUTIVE CHEF OF IXI’IM</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-53d87535 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="53d87535" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Luis Ronzón’s early steps in the culinary world, first shaped by the originality of Chef Yuri de Gortari and later refined under the mastery of René Redzepi at Noma, sparked the distinctive sensitivity that led him to Quintonil. Years later, captivated by ancestral techniques and the mystique of Mayan culture, he found his way to Chablé Yucatán, joining the team in 2016.</p><p>Chef Luis Ronzón’s most recent accolades include Two Knives from The Best Chef Awards 2025 and the Revelation Chef title at the Food and Travel Reader Awards 2023.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-e703eff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e703eff" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-aed2db4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="aed2db4" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="655" height="541" src="https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/jorge-vallejo-1.webp" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-23779" alt="jorge-vallejo" srcset="https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/jorge-vallejo-1.webp 655w, https://yucatan.chablehotels.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2025/05/jorge-vallejo-1-300x248.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 655px) 100vw, 655px" />															</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cf2f2d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="cf2f2d0" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">JORGE VALLEJO, </h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6211fa0 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="6211fa0" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">CORPORATE CHEF of CHABLÉ HOTELS</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8b081c4 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8b081c4" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Every dish at Ixi’im reflects the great talent of Jorge Vallejo, one of the most influential Mexican chefs in the world. Awarded two MICHELIN Stars and Three Knives by The Best Chef Awards 2025 for his work at Quintonil — currently named the Best Restaurant in North America and ranked No. 3 on The World’s 50 Best Restaurants 2025 — Vallejo pays homage to the land and its native ingredients, blending ancestral techniques with his own imaginative and unmistakable style.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-1a938039 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="1a938039" data-element_type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-550df9b5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="550df9b5" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2a195a50 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider" data-id="2a195a50" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="divider.default">
							<div class="elementor-divider">
			<span class="elementor-divider-separator">
						</span>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-746fec90 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="746fec90" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-a3632d0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="a3632d0" data-element_type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b708368 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b708368" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">the ixi'im experience</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-fc2b45b elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="fc2b45b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>The cuisine at Ixi’im creates a connection between Maya agricultural techniques, the smoky flavors of Pib, the region’s Lebanese heritage, and locally sourced ingredients. We celebrate Yucatán’s bold culinary tradition with a tribute meant to be savored.</p>								</div>
