				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f6bd96b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="f6bd96b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">the awards of ixi'im</h2>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-24b90031 elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="24b90031" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>One year after its opening, Ixi’im restaurant at Chablé Yucatán was awarded the 2018 Prix de Versailles Award for the beauty of its design and architecture. Since then, the restaurant has received numerous recognitions for its cuisine, heartfelt service, wine list, and commitment to environmental and cultural preservation.</p>								</div>
